# Developer Mode on a site with the toolbar hidden (Cra's default) shows Arc's developer bar
# above that site's pages: the space colour with its diagonal stripes, the whole URL and its
# copy-link, console, network and inspect buttons (#42). Before 0.1.31 the switch saved the
# site and showed nothing until View > Show Toolbar was on (#185). The snapshot fails when no
# PaneToolbarView is on screen.
# promise: #185 #42
budget rss=600 stalls50=6   # turning developer mode on or off stalls 130–650 ms (a reload)
port 47124
cra://debug?windowSize=1280x800
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=devbar
wait 3
cra://action/toggleDeveloperMode
wait 2
snapshot PaneToolbarView developer-bar-toolbar-hidden
cra://action/toggleDeveloperMode
wait 2
